OL,3,GNEWSABurnham to ask for update on
OL,4,Akiller's sentence review
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham has said he
OL,7,Fwill ask the attorney general for an
OL,8,Fupdate on the sentencing of a driver
OL,9,Fwho fled to Latvia after killing a
OL,10,F12-year-old boy.
OL,12,FSpeaking at PMQs, Burnham also said he
OL,13,Fcould also raise the case with the
OL,14,FLatvian Prime Minister.
OL,16,FAleksanders Dolars, 23, was sentenced
OL,17,Fto nine years and four months in prison
OL,18,Fon Friday for causing the death of
OL,19,FKeaton Slater by dangerous driving in
OL,20,FCoventry in 2024. Dolars fled to Latvia
OL,21,Fafter the collision and evaded capture
OL,22,Ffor more than two years.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
